# Exemptions for: export_receipt.py scan --profile tree --allow-file tools/tree-scan.allow <tracked files>
# Columns are separated by TABs: GLOB, RULE, REASON. Every line needs a reason. Keep this list short.
!allow-exact	Yoga	Product name of the test laptop.
!allow-word	yoga	The host name of the development machine equals the product name, which is part of file and device-tree names.
tests/test_export_receipt.py	*	Scanner test: invented paths, addresses and keys are the test input.
