tests/test_public_results.py	*	Scanner test: invented paths, addresses and keys are the test input.
tools/export_receipt.py	*	The scanner itself: rule text and help examples.
tools/backup_sanitize.py	*	The pre-push scanner itself: rule text.
tests/test_bootstrap.py	home-path	Invented path used as test input.
tests/test_bootstrap.py	email	Git identity of a synthetic fixture (example.invalid).
tests/test_source_archive.py	email	Git identity of a synthetic fixture (example.invalid).
